+/// on the runtime's threads that do its frame work: the scheduler, which submits what the render
+/// thread waits for in `waitUntilScheduled`, and the handler pool, which runs its handlers. A
+/// user-interactive thread is timeshare, and its priority decays under its own load (47 to 37,
